sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Event as Event
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Event: submitForApproval()
    Note over Event: Policies: eventRead, eventWrite, eventExecute
    Note over Event: Guards (3)
    Event->>Event: guard[0]: self.stage == #quot;planning#quot;
    Event->>Event: guard[1]: self.plannedAt != null
    Event->>Event: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Event->>Event: mutate.stage
    Event->>EventBus: emit EventSubmittedForApproval on event.submitted_for_approval
    Event-->>-Client: void